WEBVTT

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:09.760
<i>The countless flowers,
enveloped in light…</i>

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:20.100
<i>…gaze at tomorrow
with unwavering eyes.</i>

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:39.350
<i>Everyone wishes for me to be pure…</i>

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:46.810
<i>…but what can I bring
with me to the frayed skies?</i>

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:53.900
<i>What I’ve made my own
by breaking off flowers in bloom…</i>

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:59.480
<i>All such sinful things…</i>

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:06.960
<i>Why did I stop making
promises with the future?</i>

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:14.260
<i>Because even if I try
to run far from all the pain…</i>

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:20.930
<i>…a cold wind rustles
my hair… Don’t you see?</i>

00:01:20.930 --> 00:01:28.370
<i>Where can I ever find the answer?</i>

00:01:32.530 --> 00:01:35.990
I could’ve sworn it was
somewhere around here…

00:01:42.070 --> 00:01:43.290
Right, Neviril?

00:01:58.020 --> 00:02:00.000
Around this area, our nation…

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.930
…shares a border not only with
Shoukoku but also with the highlands.

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:09.400
Perhaps the spot where Shoukoku’s
aerial base was found the other day…

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:12.410
…was within the highland border.

00:02:12.410 --> 00:02:15.900
How would you interpret that in the
clearest and most pessimistic terms?

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:20.910
I’d have to say the highlands and
Shoukoku have formed an alliance…

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:24.410
What is the center doing?

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:26.990
Nothing.

00:02:26.990 --> 00:02:29.260
For the next few days, the Messis…

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:32.730
…will dry-dock and undergo
maintenance for our return trip.

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:35.600
I know that times are grim…

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:38.420
…but I hope you sibyllae
will enjoy the time off.

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:42.160
There’s been far
too much tragedy lately.

00:02:44.270 --> 00:02:48.180
Yes… And most likely,
more lies ahead.

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:54.190
<b>Sacrosanct</b>

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:18.920
Oh, someone was here.

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:20.340
Sibylla Morinas…

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:23.110
I’ll leave right away.

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:27.680
Don’t worry about it. I’m going
to be a man myself after all.

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:36.360
Still, that really blew me away.

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:39.150
Who knew the Simoun gem
gauged people’s emotions?

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:45.300
It shows you that we understand
nothing about the Simouns even now.

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:47.160
It does look that way.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:51.910
You said so yourself, remember?
That first day we met…

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:57.670
Oh, sorry.
I just remembered, you see…

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:00.170
S-Something
tells me this isn’t good…

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:04.680
Well, you said this before.
That years ago, you and Floe…

00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:08.820
Actually, Floe and I used to be in love.

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:10.760
I-In love?

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:15.020
To tell the truth, I didn’t think
you made a very good couple…

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:16.270
Oh, are you mad?

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:22.780
If I tell you something now, will you
keep it between the two of us?

00:04:25.370 --> 00:04:30.160
It’s true I did harbor what could
be called affection for Sibylla Floe.

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:31.200
However…

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:36.420
Since she was
a sacred sibylla, I just couldn’t…

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:38.710
Take it to the next level.

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:41.280
That’s right.

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:45.190
No matter how
aggressively she pursued?

00:04:45.190 --> 00:04:47.470
That’s right. The thing is…

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:49.900
Listen, Waporif.

00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:52.330
You and I were lovers.

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:56.520
If anyone asks, that’s how
you’ll answer. Understand?

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:06.740
Don’t worry. I won’t tell anybody.

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:11.290
But a story this funny…
I wonder if I can hold out?

00:05:11.860 --> 00:05:13.290
Sibylla Morinas!

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:21.960
Anyway… I don’t know
about the “sacred” part.

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:26.220
Can we really be that big of a deal?

00:05:27.230 --> 00:05:31.960
You feel that way because you have
yet to truly understand who you are.

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:36.230
I wonder if that’s all there is to it?

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:40.860
Is that thing really gonna work?

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:42.990
Be patient. Be patient.

00:05:42.990 --> 00:05:44.990
I’ve seen it in a book.

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:46.570
Well, even so…

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:48.340
Here’s one!

00:05:48.690 --> 00:05:50.120
Mamina, that’s awesome!

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:54.120
Hey, Para-sama, it’s amazing!
Come over here and see!

00:05:56.690 --> 00:05:57.620
Sure.

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:01.630
I guess Kaim’s back
to calling her “Para-sama.”

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:14.140
What a lovely sound…
The laughter of young girls.

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:17.580
Captain, were we
really like that once?

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:21.820
Well, I have a feeling that
we must have been once…

00:06:21.820 --> 00:06:24.150
But wait, were we really?

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:38.650
You called for me, Sibylla Dominüra?

00:06:38.650 --> 00:06:40.170
First, let us pray.

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:50.360
I need something done in secret,
and I can ask no one but you.

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:52.390
The Simouns must
never be violated…

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:55.890
…as they are the holy
vessels of gods, correct?

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:57.310
Yes.

00:06:57.310 --> 00:07:00.060
And this divine vessel has fallen.

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:02.440
Why?

00:07:03.760 --> 00:07:07.110
You should already know
the answer to that question.

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:10.450
If you can’t bring
yourself to say it, allow me.

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:14.910
Because the Simouns
are machines, nothing more.

00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:18.950
The Simoun gems,
which gauge our souls…

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:20.940
The helical motors…

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:23.960
Granted, some mysteries remain.

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:26.960
Nevertheless, the truth
is just as you described.

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:33.180
The Simouns’ undeniable superiority
over other nations has now been lost.

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:37.670
In the not-so-distant future,
the military dynamic between…

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:41.730
…Simulacrum Kyuukoku and our
neighboring countries will be reversed.

00:07:43.800 --> 00:07:45.690
Dismantle a Simoun.

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:50.690
You’re the one who said
they were nothing but machines.

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:55.200
With all due respect,
Sibylla Dominüra…

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:59.420
…that is something
we’ve all been long aware of.

00:07:59.420 --> 00:08:02.560
But people have looked
upon these “mere machines”…

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:05.960
…as something divine and
sacrosanct, with love and respect.

00:08:06.470 --> 00:08:09.460
And why do you think that is?

00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:15.180
Because all we have are the Simouns.
All we have are the Simouns.

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:20.500
And to desecrate a Simoun
is something I simply cannot do.

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:28.610
You know it as well as I do.

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:39.000
If we can unlock all
of the Simouns’ secrets…

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:41.290
…our country,
Kyuukoku, will be saved.

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:47.420
Something’s not right.

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:50.300
After all this searching,
how come we haven’t found it yet?

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:52.760
Why?

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:58.260
They could’ve moved the base
because we found them.

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:01.430
Let’s head back.

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:04.940
Hold on. If I’m right,
we’ve got to check…

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:05.940
Turn back!

00:09:16.460 --> 00:09:19.530
So you’re not even
going to ask my opinion.

00:09:20.230 --> 00:09:23.540
It’s just the two of us.
We can’t bring it to a vote.

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:27.370
You don’t think we could ever
have the same opinion, Neviril?

00:10:05.110 --> 00:10:08.750
I’d never before seen
a cockpit mangled so badly…

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:11.340
…until that day.

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:18.430
I could imagine the sheer shock
and pressure sustained in that blast.

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:24.180
And then… when I had taken apart
the twisted wreck of the cockpit…

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:27.180
…I didn’t find Sibylla Amuria inside.

00:10:27.930 --> 00:10:31.640
But judging how
the cockpit had been mangled…

00:10:31.640 --> 00:10:34.440
…it’s not plausible that
she’d been thrown out.

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:45.410
In that case,
where did Sibylla Amuria go?

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:49.580
Have you made up your mind?

00:10:52.390 --> 00:10:53.840
I thought I had refused.

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:56.050
We’re running out of time.

00:10:56.500 --> 00:10:59.200
Our neighboring countries are allying.

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:02.070
That aerial base is one good example.

00:11:02.070 --> 00:11:04.050
Without us knowing a thing…

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:09.200
“Us”? Who do you
mean by “us,” Sibylla Dominüra?

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:11.310
Just who are you?

00:11:30.260 --> 00:11:32.310
What did Dominüra want?

00:11:32.310 --> 00:11:35.790
Oh, she said
Rimone’s Simoun is malfunctioning.

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:40.490
You’re not…

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:43.010
…a very good liar now, are you?

00:11:46.240 --> 00:11:48.010
I guess you’re right.

00:12:02.890 --> 00:12:04.070
Yun…

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:08.610
If Neviril…

00:12:08.610 --> 00:12:12.040
Rather, if anything happens,
I want to take off at once.

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:15.470
When the time comes,
I want you to be my pair.

00:12:17.810 --> 00:12:21.380
The sum of one person’s soul
is equal to everyone else’s.

00:12:23.350 --> 00:12:26.640
Should you overestimate its value,
the decisions will be flawed.

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:31.930
Of course, if our comrades
find themselves in danger…

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:33.600
…it’s a given that
I would take off at once.

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:45.660
The Simouns are activated
by its two helical motors.

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:51.120
Well, to be precise, you could
say they’re being manipulated.

00:12:51.710 --> 00:12:56.120
And beyond that fact,
we know nothing about the Simouns.

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:58.950
Waporif, don’t tell me that…

00:12:58.950 --> 00:13:01.360
You said it once yourself.

00:13:01.360 --> 00:13:03.980
That I should dismantle a Simoun.

00:13:16.870 --> 00:13:21.320
After flying a Simoun…
sensing that Simoun…

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:23.570
…I did learn something.

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:27.200
That they are divine vehicles.

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:42.500
That they’re sacred…

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:47.590
Just like the sibyllae themselves,
the Simouns are sacrosanct.

00:13:48.330 --> 00:13:49.560
However…

00:13:51.570 --> 00:13:57.020
I might be about to desecrate
that which is sacred.

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:12.780
They didn’t get back tonight.

00:14:12.780 --> 00:14:17.040
It’s just a reconnaissance mission.
You don’t have to worry.

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:18.420
Aer…

00:14:19.230 --> 00:14:23.360
Do you think she’s still
planning to do an Emerald Ri Majon?

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:28.480
They say things work out
if you’re in love. If you love your pair…

00:14:28.480 --> 00:14:31.030
…it makes your
Ri Majons turn out right.

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:34.260
H-Hold on. That’s what I told Aer.

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:38.730
Is that right, Floe? Have you
really ever experienced true love?

00:14:39.280 --> 00:14:40.990
True love?

00:14:40.990 --> 00:14:44.330
Hey, don’t insult me!
I’m always in true love…

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:46.480
Would you be quiet?

00:15:23.530 --> 00:15:26.470
I’m sure you think
I’m out of my element here.

00:15:26.470 --> 00:15:28.400
But I promise it’s a fine cup of tea.

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:32.030
What did you want to talk about?

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:37.040
Sibylla Dominüra,
you must forgive me.

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:40.910
I’ve looked into your background a bit.

00:15:43.050 --> 00:15:45.920
The only remaining survivor
of the fabled Chor Dextra.

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:48.210
Chor Dextra…

00:15:48.780 --> 00:15:52.600
Today, its very existence has
been erased from the records…

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:57.330
…formed for the sole purpose of
completing the Emerald Ri Majon.

00:15:57.330 --> 00:15:59.430
A phantom chor.

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:04.970
The Emerald Ri Majon failed…

00:16:04.970 --> 00:16:07.940
…and the rest of
the sibyllae lost their lives.

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:12.580
And now you’re a sibylla under
the military council’s direct command.

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:17.240
An appointment that even those
high priestesses had no say in.

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:25.630
Yes, that’s right.

00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:28.710
You invited me to tea to discuss that?

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:34.300
No, to inform you that the plans
you’re about to execute…

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:38.680
…are being watched
silently by certain people.

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:45.680
No matter what one intends,
in order to see it through…

00:16:45.680 --> 00:16:49.190
…we must all have something
to believe in wholeheartedly.

00:16:50.680 --> 00:16:52.170
Believe in…

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:55.340
Something worth believing in…

00:16:56.250 --> 00:16:57.370
That would be…

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:58.450
The Simouns.

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:14.130
Whether their
mystique is valid or not…

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:16.970
…doesn’t matter.

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:12.580
The Simouns
are machines, nothing more…

00:19:13.260 --> 00:19:16.170
They are not
divine vessels by any means.

00:20:09.970 --> 00:20:11.140
So it’s done.

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:12.310
Yes.

00:20:13.280 --> 00:20:15.810
But I found nothing inside.

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:20.920
At least, not anything
we’d be able to comprehend.

00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:27.370
What’s there is nothing but a helix.

00:20:28.130 --> 00:20:31.370
The only thing we’re
capable of understanding is…

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:41.130
Sibylla Dominüra…

00:20:49.220 --> 00:20:50.350
It can’t be…

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:57.370
You can…

00:20:57.370 --> 00:20:59.860
You’re able to see
something, aren’t you?

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:04.700
You can see something!

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:06.360
What can you see?

00:21:07.040 --> 00:21:08.370
Sibylla Dominüra!

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:19.590
That voice just now…

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:23.090
Dominüra…

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:25.970
— Let’s go see what happened.
— She’s on the flight deck!

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:30.560
Take Sibylla Dominüra to my room.

00:21:30.560 --> 00:21:31.610
Yes, sir.

00:21:31.610 --> 00:21:33.430
What happened? Is Dominüra…

00:21:33.430 --> 00:21:36.510
She’s all right!
Sibyllae, if you please…

00:21:36.510 --> 00:21:38.940
Sibyllae, if you would
please step aside…

00:22:21.610 --> 00:22:23.650
Huh? I just heard…

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:26.740
…somebody crying.

00:22:41.060 --> 00:22:47.740
<i>It is played by my wounds…
the song of prayer.</i>

00:22:47.740 --> 00:22:52.010
<i>Let it ring out over
the grieving universe.</i>

00:22:52.010 --> 00:22:59.050
<i>Can we change tomorrow?
Don’t be afraid.</i>

00:22:59.050 --> 00:23:06.650
<i>I want to let you know
how my heart’s overflowing.</i>

00:23:15.460 --> 00:23:19.570
<i>“I want to get closer to you.”
“I want to feel your pulse.”</i>

00:23:19.570 --> 00:23:24.740
<i>I was too defiant,
and I took the long way around.</i>

00:23:24.740 --> 00:23:28.720
<i>The blue moon is swaying silently.</i>

00:23:28.720 --> 00:23:32.590
<i>My true heart’s desire is you.</i>

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:38.090
<i>I can’t reach you.
My tears of pain trickle down.</i>

00:23:38.650 --> 00:23:44.170
<i>Soar away into the sky, song of prayer.</i>

00:23:44.170 --> 00:23:47.570
<i>Carrying my love that came too late.</i>

00:23:47.570 --> 00:23:53.270
<i>What can I do to change tomorrow?</i>

00:23:53.270 --> 00:23:59.610
<i>Just hold on to “now” the way it is…</i>

00:24:04.920 --> 00:24:06.630
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:24:06.080 --> 00:24:07.860
Shoukoku’s upgraded aircraft…

00:24:07.860 --> 00:24:12.380
…are relentlessly threatening us,
and our forces are being scattered.

00:24:13.340 --> 00:24:15.430
Next time on Simoun…

00:24:15.430 --> 00:24:17.890
One, and Then Another.

00:24:15.430 --> 00:24:19.930
<b>One, and Then Another</b>
